auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
  bearer_auth: Bearer {{token}}
}

docs {
  # NHCX

  Every API this console knows about, generated from the repository by `npm run collection:build`.

  Run **Session > Session token** first: it stores the token the rest of the collection sends.

  The exchange calls (`/v1/...`) carry a JWE, not a FHIR bundle. The body here is the envelope with a
  placeholder payload; build a real one in the console's Simulator, which encrypts the bundle for the
  recipient's certificate and sets the `x-hcx-*` headers this collection shows.
}
